<div class="values-page">
  <div class="inner">

    <header class="page-hdr page-hdr--tall">
      {{!-- ✏️ EDIT: Page title and subtitle --}}
      <h1 class="page-title">Things I believe in.</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">From some patterns I've noticed in the way I think, work, and try to live.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="values-list">

      {{!-- ✏️ EDIT each value below --}}

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">01</span>Always be curious, never be certain.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">Question things. Question people. Question yourself. The moment you think you have it all figured out is the moment you stop getting better.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">02</span>Take risks. You'll regret it if you don't.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">Be it starting something new, or betting on yourself with impossibles, it's scary every single time. Do it anyway. Playing it safe is also a choice, and it has consequences.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">03</span>Be the person people can count on.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">Because that's who you are. Own the outcome, own the failure, own all of it. That's what trust is built on.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">04</span>Life is short. Enjoy it like you know that.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">Spend time with your people, do things outside of work that make you feel alive. You don't have to earn that. It's just part of living well.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">05</span>Be clear in everything.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">In what you say, in what you do, in what you want. Clarity should act as a habit, and it makes everything: work, relationships, decisions so much easier.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">06</span>Don't lose yourself around people.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">You'll meet all kinds of people. Some will push you, some will pull you. Know who you are before walking into any room, that self-awareness is worth more than most things.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-item">
        <h3 class="value-title"><span class="vn">07</span>Read. It does something to you over time.</h3>
        <p class="value-desc">It changes how you think, how you see people, how you carry yourself. It's one of the few things that actually sticks.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</div>
